    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">automatically remove them from text data [34]. Second, LLMs can process text data at high speed, making them an efficient tool for de-identification tasks.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
