    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We evaluate M OL B ERT when used directly and when specialized for downstream applications</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In a wide range of 15 medical experiments, LVM-Med sets a new state-of-the-art</hasEvidenceText>
