    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The level of additive noise corresponding to a given signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) is calculated based on the signal power</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This limitation arises because these models were trained on contexts not exceeding 4k, impairing their accuracy</hasEvidenceText>
